---

Acknowledgements:

The architectural pattern of this project — running ONNX Runtime Web inside a
TouchDesigner-hosted webserverDAT and exchanging frames + predictions over
WebSocket — was inspired by `yolo-touchdesigner` by Torin Blankensmith
(https://github.com/torinmb/yolo-touchdesigner, AGPL-3.0+). The implementation
in this repository is original, written from scratch using ONNX Runtime Web's
official samples and Ultralytics' ONNX export documentation as primary
references. No source code from yolo-touchdesigner has been copied into this
project.
